  "description": "Test doubles for Webority.Ai: a scriptable chat client that records every call and answers with scripted replies, tool calls and token usage, and an agent factory that builds real agent-framework agents over it, with the same tool discovery, schema and temperature rules as the real transports, and a scripted Azure OpenAI endpoint that runs a product's own registration and the whole agent chain with only the network replaced. AiEvalSet, AiGoldenCase and AiEvalRunner score a surface's replies against golden cases with a judgment use, from a test or a script. AiActionSeed and AiJudgmentSeed build action, judgment and outcome rows for seeding a consumer's database in tests. Products test their agents without Azure. No test-framework dependency.",
